2026-10-31 story-map.md
Mistake: stories named system steps a person never sees (Read Board Columns, Read Fidelity Progress, Refresh Board After Tool Calls, Name Active Ticket), an epic named after the tool (Keep Claude Code Informed), and one behaviour of a display written as its own story (Scroll Fixed Columns).
Correction: a story says what is displayed and where. Steps and events become acceptance criteria on the story that displays the result. Reads, refreshes, and scrolling are not stories.

2026-10-31 story-map.md
Mistake: too many stories split along what the board displays, not clustered around what moves the work forward.
Correction: rebuilt from the person's edited story-map.drawio. Stacked cards are one Story with acceptance criteria, marked in the markdown, so the map has fewer stories grouped by functionality.

2026-10-31 story-map.md
Mistake: a story named after the mechanism, Open Board Command.
Correction: name the verb and noun of what the person does, Open Board. The slash command goes in the evidence line.

